        "facts": [
          "Benchmark Suite / landed-cost-evaluation",
          "Authoritative rules - all dates inclusive; all money SGD.",
          "Business cutoff: 2026-11-18. Use this date, not the computer clock.",
          "Order quantity: 3. Total order budget including tax: SGD 15000.00.",
          "Minimum CPU cores 40; RAM 384 GB; warranty 48 months.",
          "Maximum delivery lead time: 14 days. Tax rate: 0.08.",
          "For each vendor first retain ACTIVE quotes issued on/before cutoff and valid_until on/after it.",
          "Choose the greatest (issued_on, revision) among those valid quotes for that vendor.",
          "Then test hardware, warranty, lead time and budget; never fall back to an older quote.",
          "Unit price is per server. Shipping is ONCE for the whole order, not per server.",
          "Tax basis applies to BOTH unit price and shipping; no other charges or discounts.",
          "EXCLUSIVE: landed = (quantity * unit price + shipping) * (1 + tax rate).",
          "INCLUSIVE: landed = quantity * unit price + shipping; do not add tax again.",
          "Round only the final landed total to cents, half up; compare rounded total <= budget.",
          "Budget remaining = budget - rounded landed total. Include EVERY qualifying vendor only.",
          "",
          "Deliver landed-cost.csv as UTF-8 CSV, exact header:",
          "vendor_id,quote_id,cpu_cores,ram_gb,landed_total_sgd,budget_remaining_sgd",
          "Row order does not affect grading. Numbers without currency signs or thousands separators.",
          "Upload the CSV to the same ownCloud case folder. Share the CSV publicly (no password/login).",
          "Save only its public URL in local link.txt and post that URL in the suite RocketChat room."
